    "created_at": "2020-06-10T06:01:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-10T06:02:15Z",
    "body": "While I don't mind using color to *add* information, I've been very wary of using color *alone* to convey important information ever since our first command status module turned out to be [unusable by colorblind users](https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/130).\r\n\r\nIf we can work out some colors that will be noticeable under a wide range of terminal colorschemes and have noticeable change for our colorblind users, it might be workable.",
